{
  "Locking the CMS interface": [
    "The CMS interface is frozen. The files below are recorded by SHA-256 and",
    ".github/scripts/interface-locked.cjs fails Checks on any change to one of them, on a pull request or a push to main.",
    "Locked: the page (index.html), its look (styles.css), every front-end script, and the firm's marks.",
    "Not locked: the server (functions/), the deploy configuration, the docs, and the Training Library's data",
    "(mock-cases.js, mock-id-photos/, blueprint-content.js), so the API can still be fixed and the cases kept up.",
    "To change a locked file: set its \"locked\" to false in this file, in its own commit, with the reason in the",
    "commit message. Once the change is approved, run `node .github/scripts/interface-locked.cjs --relock` to",
    "record the new hashes and set \"locked\" back to true.",
    "A red check here is not a thing to work around: it means an edit reached the frozen CMS interface."
  ],
